{"seq":2,"slug":"bookkeeping-methods","title":"记账方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/bookkeeping-methods","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"记账方法\">记账方法</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>借贷记账法是当今全球通用的复式记账方法，也是中职会计专业必须熟练掌握的核心技能。与单式记账只记录一方变动不同，复式记账对每笔经济业务都在两个或两个以上账户中进行等额记录，从而实现数据的自动校验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复式记账的基本原理\">复式记账的基本原理</h3><p>复式记账的理论基础来自会计等式。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>资产</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>负债</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>所有者权益</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{资产} = \\text{负债} + \\text{所有者权益}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资产</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">负债</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有者权益</span></span></span></span></span></span> 恒等，任何一笔经济业务必然引起至少两个项目的变动，因此需要在对应的两个（或多个）账户中同时记录，以保持等式平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;经济业务发生&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;分析影响哪些账户&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;确定借贷方向&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;登记各账户&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;试算平衡验证&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"经济业务发生\"] --&gt; B[\"分析影响哪些账户\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"确定借贷方向\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"登记各账户\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"试算平衡验证\"]</pre><h3 id=\"借贷记账法规则\">借贷记账法规则</h3><p>借贷记账法以&quot;借&quot;和&quot;贷&quot;作为记账符号，其核心规则：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>有借必有贷，借贷必相等</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这十个字是编制会计分录的最高准则。每笔分录的借方金额合计必须等于贷方金额合计。</p>\n<p>各类账户的借贷方向规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账户类别</th>\n<th>借方</th>\n<th>贷方</th>\n<th>余额方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资产类</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td>减少</td>\n<td>借方余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负债类</td>\n<td>减少</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td>贷方余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有者权益类</td>\n<td>减少</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td>贷方余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收入类</td>\n<td>减少/转出</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td>期末无余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费用类</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td>减少/转出</td>\n<td>期末无余额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>记忆技巧：&quot;资费借增&quot;——资产和费用类账户借方记增加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"账户结构\">账户结构</h3><p>账户是根据会计科目开设的记录工具。其基本结构为&quot;T&quot;字形：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"          库存现金&#10;    ─────────────────────&#10;    借方 │          贷方&#10;    ─────────────────────&#10;    期初余额 1,000 │&#10;    收入现金 5,000 │ 支付费用 3,000&#10;                   │ 存入银行 2,000&#10;    ─────────────────────&#10;    本期借方合计 5,000 │ 本期贷方合计 5,000&#10;    期末余额 1,000 │\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>          库存现金</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ─────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    借方 │          贷方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ─────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    期初余额 1,000 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收入现金 5,000 │ 支付费用 3,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                   │ 存入银行 2,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ─────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    本期借方合计 5,000 │ 本期贷方合计 5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    期末余额 1,000 │</span></span></code></pre></div><p>期末余额计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>期末借方余额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>期初借方余额</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>本期借方发生额</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>本期贷方发生额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{期末借方余额} = \\text{期初借方余额} + \\text{本期借方发生额} - \\text{本期贷方发生额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期末借方余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初借方余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本期借方发生额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本期贷方发生额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"账户分类\">账户分类</h3><p>按经济内容分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资产类账户</strong>：库存现金、银行存款、应收账款、原材料、固定资产</li>\n<li><strong>负债类账户</strong>：短期借款、应付账款、应付职工薪酬、应交税费</li>\n<li><strong>所有者权益类账户</strong>：实收资本、资本公积、盈余公积、利润分配</li>\n<li><strong>损益类账户</strong>：主营业务收入、管理费用、销售费用、财务费用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"会计分录编制\">会计分录编制</h3><p>会计分录是记录经济业务的标准格式。按涉及账户数量分为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>简单分录</strong>：一借一贷</li>\n<li><strong>复合分录</strong>：一借多贷、多借一贷、多借多贷</li>\n</ul>\n<p>编制步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>分析业务涉及哪些账户</li>\n<li>判断各账户的增减变动</li>\n<li>确定记入借方还是贷方</li>\n<li>确定金额并检查借贷是否相等</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：企业用银行存款 50,000 元购入原材料，增值税专用发票注明税额 6,500 元。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"借：原材料           50,000&#10;    应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  6,500&#10;  贷：银行存款         56,500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>借：原材料           50,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  6,500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  贷：银行存款         56,500</span></span></code></pre></div><p>验证：借方合计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50,000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6,500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>56,500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50{,}000 + 6{,}500 = 56{,}500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> = 贷方合计 ✓</p>\n<h3 id=\"试算平衡\">试算平衡</h3><p>试算平衡是验证记账正确性的重要手段。原理：由于每笔分录借贷金额相等，则所有账户的发生额和余额也应满足平衡关系。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>借方发生额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>贷方发生额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{借方发生额} = \\sum \\text{贷方发生额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">借方发生额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">贷方发生额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>借方余额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>贷方余额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{借方余额} = \\sum \\text{贷方余额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">借方余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">贷方余额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>试算平衡表格式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账户名称</th>\n<th>借方发生额</th>\n<th>贷方发生额</th>\n<th>借方余额</th>\n<th>贷方余额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存现金</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>3,000</td>\n<td>3,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行存款</td>\n<td>100,000</td>\n<td>56,500</td>\n<td>43,500</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>...</td>\n<td>...</td>\n<td>...</td>\n<td>...</td>\n<td>...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>xxx</strong></td>\n<td><strong>xxx</strong></td>\n<td><strong>xxx</strong></td>\n<td><strong>xxx</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：试算平衡了不代表没有错误（如借贷方向全部记反、科目用错但金额相等），但不平衡一定说明有错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年的财务软件已普遍内置&quot;智能分录推荐&quot;功能：输入业务摘要后，系统自动建议借贷科目。然而，软件推荐的准确率在复杂业务场景下约为70-80%，仍需会计人员凭借扎实的记账功底进行判断和修正。特别是涉及多步骤交易（如&quot;以物抵债&quot;、&quot;债转股&quot;）时，理解借贷记账法原理的人才能识别软件推荐的偏差。</p>\n<p>此外，政府会计制度下的&quot;双基础、双分录&quot;模式（财务会计用权责发生制，预算会计用收付实现制，同一笔业务做两套分录）也要求从业者对借贷记账法有更深入的理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>编制以下业务的会计分录：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>企业收到投资者投入资本 200,000 元，存入银行</li>\n<li>从银行借入短期借款 100,000 元</li>\n<li>以银行存款支付本月房租 8,000 元</li>\n<li>赊销商品一批，售价 30,000 元，增值税 3,900 元</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>某企业期初银行存款余额为 150,000 元。本月发生以下业务：收到货款 80,000 元，支付材料款 45,000 元，支付工资 60,000 元，收到借款 100,000 元。计算银行存款的期末余额。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>以下试算平衡表中有一处错误，请找出并更正：</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账户</th>\n<th>借方余额</th>\n<th>贷方余额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>银行存款</td>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应收账款</td>\n<td>20,000</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期借款</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>30,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实收资本</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>50,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合计</strong></td>\n<td><strong>70,000</strong></td>\n<td><strong>80,000</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>讨论：为什么说&quot;试算平衡了不代表记账一定正确&quot;？请举出两种试算平衡但实际存在错误的情形。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>借贷记账法通过&quot;有借必有贷，借贷必相等&quot;这一简明规则，将会计等式的平衡关系落实到每一笔日常记录中。掌握各类账户的借贷方向、熟练编制会计分录、并通过试算平衡进行自查，是会计核算的基本功。这些技能需要通过大量重复练习形成&quot;肌肉记忆&quot;——看到业务就能快速反应出正确的借贷方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"记账方法","id":"记账方法"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"复式记账的基本原理","id":"复式记账的基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"借贷记账法规则","id":"借贷记账法规则"},{"level":3,"text":"账户结构","id":"账户结构"},{"level":3,"text":"账户分类","id":"账户分类"},{"level":3,"text":"会计分录编制","id":"会计分录编制"},{"level":3,"text":"试算平衡","id":"试算平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会计基础与原则","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/accounting-basics-principles"},"next":{"title":"会计凭证与账簿","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/accounting-vouchers-books"}}